{"sections":[{"slug":"规范变换","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"规范变换"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">规范变换</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"规范变换"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当我们可以用多种方式描述同一个对象时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">描述方式之间的转变就称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">规范变换</span></strong>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">主丛的规范变换</span></h3>\n<p>$G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变自同构称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">规范变换</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">其规范变换一一对应于</span> $\\operatorname{Ad}P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\operatorname{Ad}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在自身上的伴随作用</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">规范变换作用于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}